ot  her gloves are gone just another victim  of Joel Schumacher's madness  the spiked bracelets that wasn't the  only time Poison Ivy's arms with a  victim of bad continuity she's wearing  thin leaf-like gloves when she first  welcomes Robin into a lair but when she  angrily pushes him into a gross swimming  pool she's suddenly wearing spiky rubber  bracelets the transporting gun in Batman  Begins Bruce Wayne is waiting at the  courthouse to shoot Joe Chill the man  who killed his parents a female assassin  runs up and pushes a pistol up against  the criminals chest instead when she  shoots a split second later she's  holding the gun at least a foot away not  even Batman moves that fast where I oh  here  Joker's fast hands during the iconic  interrogation scene in the Dark Knight  the Joker and Batman tangled while the  Gotham City Police Department looks on  but it seems like they got a little more  tangled than anyone expected as Batman  holds Joker up against a wall  Joker holds on to Batman's arms with a  chin up grip but when the camera angle  changes the Clown Prince is doing a  pull-up instead before his hands quickly  return to their first position the  botched headline Gotham's copy editors  should probably get fired for this one  or at least the props Department in The  Dark Knight Rises Bruce Wayne stumbles  upon a newspaper headline while  conducting some online research about  the cat burglar in town where the word  heist is clearly misspelled I guess it  could have been worse thanks for  watching subscribe to our YouTube  channel to watch more videos like the  one you just saw and leave us a comment  to let us know which Batman movies  mistakes you've noticed
 

